  "summary": "Using two satellite instruments that did not saturate, the team rebuilt the 2 to 255 MeV spectrum of GRB 221009A over time. They report a spectral bump near 2 MeV and confirm a narrow line that drifts to lower energy as 1/t. They read this as hinting at a magnetically dominated jet with an empty center, but that is an interpretation of a single event.",
